  "title": "The Role of Homeownership on Black Wealth",
  "summary": "Homeownership plays a pivotal role in building intergenerational wealth and remains the single most effective way for many Americans to build wealth. Today, homeownership largely remains elusive in the African American community. To understand why, we must examine where we've been, historically, and what obstacles have prevented the growth of Black wealth.",
